<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Ngindo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ja Paulo kwa Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">File</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ja Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu chenje kichoko cha Filemoni kiandikigwa na ndundame Paulo (Lipungu lya 1:1). Iwechakine Paulo pakiba mukipungo ku Loma, yene anda akiba ku Loma penia mmanya balua jenje jiandikigwa chaka cha 61 kuboka pukubelekwa Kilisto, nga chaka ucho pikiandikigwa kitabu cha Kolosai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo anhwandakila balua jenje mundu jumwe jwakemigwa Filemoni. Ojwakiba jumwe kati ja bandu abunhwamini Kilisto na akiba na akabanda bakwe. Paulo anhwandakila kupala kunnyopa akunhwukumuje mmanda jwakwe jwakemigwa Onesimo jwakatila kuboka ku Filemoni. Kengama malagilo ga Loma Filemoni akiba nuwecho gu kunhukumu Onesimo akomigwe. Paulo ngampembela Filemoni kupala annyeketele Onesimo ammone andi nnongo mukulondana na Kilisto kabe annyopa Filemoni annekekeye Onesimo kupala abegelele pamwe na Paulo (Lipungu lya 1:13-14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Agabi mukitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ampata abali Filemoni, lipungu lya 1:1-3.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe Paulo annyopa Filemoni ampokele Onesimo andi nnongo mu Kilisto (Lipungu lya 1:4-21).</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ajomole kukutangacha mawacho gakwe ga katyangila na kapata abali (Lipungu lya 1:22-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ne Napaulo, ndabigwe magambu ga kummegele Kilisto Yesu. Nenga pamwe na nnongo gwito Timoteo.</para>
  <para style="p">Tunhwandaki mwe maganja bito mana Filemoni, makamwa maengo majito, <verse number="2" style="v"/>na bandu abunhwamini Kilisto abakongana kachinu na ku nnombo gwito Afia nu ku lityala nnyito Alikipo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nnoongo Awabito mampegange tengela nu upeele na Angwana bito ana Yesu Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="s">Lipalano na imani ja Filemoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kila kingobu pang'ongalela, nankombake mwe ma Filemoni nu kunnumba Nnoongo, <verse number="5" style="v"/>gambu nyoine pamaamini Angwana bito ana Yesu na pamapala bandu ba Nnoongo boa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nannyope ku Nnoongo mme na makakala gakalenge bandu bange imani inu kupala bamanye kipola gwambone gutubi nago twenga tatulondine na Kilisto. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Malongo bango, lipalano linu linhalali muno na limbi mwojo! Mwenga mijikalamwie myojo ja bandu ba Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="s">Paulo annyopa Filimoni ampokele Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwa magambu genia, ne nalongo binu kukulondana na Kilisto, kabi nhotwi kunhwamulu panga jogopa nkamule champaligwa kamula, <verse number="9" style="v"/>nambu magambu nde mpala, mbaya nannyope. Ndenda yene iganukube ne Paulo ng'oime na ngoe ne mbi napungwa kwa magambu ga kummegele Yesu Kilisto. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nannyopa mannyangate Onesimo jwenio ngoe manango kukunhwamini kwakwe Kilisto ne mbi na awamundu panakiba mikipungo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pukutumbula akiba kile chamboneje kwinu nambu ngoe kile chambone kwango uyo na kwinu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngoe nammuya kabele kwinu, jwombe mbi kumpala muno. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kabimbai atame nanenga anyangate pampala kunyangata mwe kiti mbi pamba mukipungo magambu gu kutangacha Nhwalo Gwambone. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu mbaije kunnachimicha unyangate, nambu mbala ntendi pampala mmene yene ngamuje chachoa mpaka nnyeketele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pangaje Onesimo ngaboka kwinu kukingobu kichoko tu, kupala abuje kabena ntame nakwe machoba goa pangapela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Jwenio mmanda kabeje, nambu kupeta mmanda, jwenio ngoe nga nnongo gwito mukulondana na Kilisto. Ambala nenga na ampala mwenga chenge muno, gambu jwenio andi mmanda na andi nnongo mukulondana na Angwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bai, anda umona ne kube nalongo binu, kwa Angwana, mampoke Onesimo andi umboke nenga. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Anda akiba annemwite kilebe, andaje akiba na ligambo kwinu, nannepa nenga. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ne Paulo andika namwene ku lukobo lwango, manannepage! Mbaije kunkombake kutenda nkweti ligambo lya bwomi kwango. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Elo, malongo bango, undende yene kukunyangata nenga ka magambu ga Angwana, ngoe mwe malongo bango mukulondana na Kilisto muwalali mwojo gwango.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nunhwamine magambu nunhwandaki ganga, manyi mankamula kupeta genia ganannengile. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pamwe na genia, umbangi chumbi chukutama gambu nhyobale Nnoongo majanga kujopa kwinu nu kumbanga kwinu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupata abali kukujomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Epafulo, mpungwa nnyango kwa magambu gukummegele Kilisto Yesu, ampata abali. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Maluko na Alistako na Dema na Luka, akakamwa maengo ajango, uyo bampatanga abali.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nnoongo ampegange upeele kuboka ka Angwana bito ana Yesu Kilisto ube pamwe na mangweto mumyojo jinu.</para>
</usx>
